-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "Поговорите с капралом Тундом Треснувшее Копыто.", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak to Corporal Thund Splithoof." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak to Corporal Thund Splithoof.",  OLD Details : "Твои благородство и героизм – высокая честь для меня, $n.$B$BИ для тебя – не менее высокая...", Details AC enUS : "You have honored me with your nobility and heroism, $N.$B$BYou have also honored them..." ; Wowhead enUS : "You have honored me with your nobility and heroism, $n.$b$bYou have also honored them..."
