-- AC datas : OLD Title : "Оскверненная руна", Title AC enUS : "Tainted Memorandum" ; Wowhead enUS : "Tainted Memorandum",  OLD Objectives : "Прочитайте оскверненную руну и поговорите с Сарипал Дымоварь в Старой Наковальне над Холодной долиной.", Objectives AC enUS : "Read the Tainted Memorandum and speak to Alamar Grimm inside Anvilmar above Coldridge Valley." ; Wowhead enUS : "Read the Tainted Memorandum and speak to Alamar Grimm inside Anvilmar above Coldridge Valley.",  OLD Details : "Пока ты мне $gпомогал:помогала;, тут вот передали для тебя руну. Найди время, чтоб ее прочитать. Думаю, она от чародейки по имени Сарипал. Когда представится возможность, навести ее в Старой Наковальне.$B$BИ будь поосторожней, $n, – таким, как ты, в этих краях не очень-то доверяют.", Details AC enUS : "While you were helping me out, this memorandum was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the warlock trainer Alamar. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance.$B$BAnd watch yerself, $N, your kind ain't too trusted 'round these parts." ; Wowhead enUS : "While you were helping me out, this memorandum was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the warlock trainer Alamar. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance.$b$bAnd watch yerself, $n, your kind ain't too trusted 'round these parts."
