-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Плеть постоянно досаждает силам Альянса. Думаю, $n, ты знаешь об этом не хуже меня. В последнее время нам удалось сделать пару интересных находок.$B$BВ Степях есть жуткие заросли терновника, называемые Курганы Иглошкурых. Сначала казалось, что там обитают только иглогривы, но теперь выясняется, что в этих зарослях гнездятся самые разнообразные чудовища. Управляет ими лич по имени Амненнар Хладовей.$B$BВо имя Света, $n! Изгони зло с холмов Иглошкурых!", Details AC enUS : "The Scourge is a persistent threat to the Alliance, a fact I am sure you know quite well. Recently, we have come across some very peculiar findings, $N.$B$BIn the Barrens lies a horrid tangle of briars called Razorfen Downs. While once it was the home of simple quilboar, now it has become apparent that a pact was made with the Scourge, creating creatures far worse... They are now ruled by the lich, Amnennar the Coldbringer.$B$BAlign yourself with the Light, $N; put an end to this evil union." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Scourge is a persistent threat to the Alliance, a fact I am sure you know quite well. Recently, we have come across some very peculiar findings, $n.$b$bIn the Barrens lies a horrid tangle of briars called Razorfen Downs. While once it was the home of simple quilboar, now it has become apparent that a pact was made with the Scourge, creating creatures far worse... They are now ruled by the lich, Amnennar the Coldbringer.$b$bAlign yourself with the Light, $n; put an end to this evil union.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Amnennar the Coldbringer slain"
