-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Привет тебе, |3-6($c)! Судя по тому, как ты держишься, тебе немало довелось повидать на белом свете. Но бьюсь об заклад, что таких доспехов, как эти, тебе видеть не доводилось!$b$bОкажи мне небольшую услугу, и я отдам их тебе в обмен на обычные поручья.$b$bМне нужен яд тварей, обитающих в Силитусе. Принеси мне этот яд и немного золотых монет, и я произведу обмен.", Details AC enUS : "Hail, $c!  I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world.  Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.$B$BPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.$B$BI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus.  Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange." ; Wowhead enUS : "Hail, $c! I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world. Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.$b$bPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.$b$bI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus. Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange."
