-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Разыскивается живым или мертвым!$B$BЗорбо Советчик разыскивается за организацию ряда спланированных нападений на Гарадар. При содействии разрушителей и шаманов преступник убил бессчетное количество орков. Зорбо вооружен, беспощаден и очень опасен.$B$BСейчас он скрывается в руинах Веселого Черепа в северных горах Награнда.$B$BУбивший или поймавший Зорбо Советчика может обратиться за наградой к стражу-смотрителю Быккроку в Гарадаре.", Details AC enUS : "Wanted: Dead or Alive$B$BZorbo the Advisor, wanted for numerous planned attacks on Garadar. Along with his reavers and shaman, Zorbo has slain countless orcs. Consider Zorbo as armed, dangerous, and merciless.$B$BZorbo makes his home in the Laughing Skull Ruins in the northern mountains of Nagrand.$B$BReward for Zorbo the Advisor's death or capture to be dispensed by Warden Bullrok at Garadar. " ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: Dead or Alive$b$bZorbo the Advisor, wanted for numerous planned attacks on Garadar. Along with his reavers and shaman, Zorbo has slain countless orcs. Consider Zorbo as armed, dangerous, and merciless.$b$bZorbo makes his home in the Laughing Skull Ruins in the northern mountains of Nagrand.$b$bReward for Zorbo the Advisor's death or capture to be dispensed by Warden Bullrok at Garadar.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Zorbo the Advisor slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Warmaul Shaman slain",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Warmaul Reaver slain"
