-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Я хочу предложить некую сделку: вы продемонстрируете свои добрые намерения и поможете мне решить одну проблему, а я помогу вам спасти товарища.$B$BОгры – заклятые враги моего народа, и недавно они вновь начали забредать в наши леса из Награнда.$B$BОдин огр, зовут его Муг'гок, очень смелый, но не особо умный. Он шатается туда-сюда, пытаясь спровоцировать нас, и тем самым доставляет много проблем своим приятелям из руин Кровавой Глазницы.", Details AC enUS : "I'd like to propose something of a trade: demonstrate your good intentions by helping me resolve a little problem, and I'll help you rescue your comrade.$B$BThe ogres are an ancient enemy of my people, and lately they have begun to filter back into our forest from the grasslands of Nagrand.$B$BOne particular ogre, Mug'gok, is quite an adventurous fellow, but none too bright. He goes back and forth between causing trouble for his friends at the Bleeding Hollow Ruins and trying to provoke us." ; Wowhead enUS : "I'd like to propose something of a trade: demonstrate your good intentions by helping me resolve a little problem, and I'll help you rescue your comrade.$b$bThe ogres are an ancient enemy of my people, and lately they have begun to filter back into our forest from the grasslands of Nagrand.$b$bOne particular ogre, Mug'gok, is quite an adventurous fellow, but none too bright. He goes back and forth between causing trouble for his friends at the Bleeding Hollow Ruins and trying to provoke us."
