-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Ты $gвыбрал:выбрала; свой путь, |3-6($c). Следуй же ему, куда бы он тебя ни привел.$B$BЕсть свои преимущества в том, чтобы иметь друзей среди верховных магов Даларана. Если будешь служить нам верой и правдой, мы щедро наградим тебя.", Details AC enUS : "You've chosen your path, $c.  Now it is up to you to travel the path to wherever it may lead.$B$BYou will find that having friends among the Archmages of Dalaran has its advantages.  Serve us well and your deeds will not go unrewarded." ; Wowhead enUS : "You've chosen your path, $c. Now it is up to you to travel the path to wherever it may lead.$b$bYou will find that having friends among the Archmages of Dalaran has its advantages. Serve us well and your deeds will not go unrewarded.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Violet Eye"
