nd execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty gnome in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Goby Blastenheimer slain"
