me fortifications.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Capture The Overlook" ; Wowhead enUS : "Capture The Overlook",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "Capture the Stadium" ; Wowhead enUS : "Capture the Stadium",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "Capture Broken Hill" ; Wowhead enUS : "Capture Broken Hill"
