-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "Отдайте генералу Маркусу Джонатану в Штормграде рекомендации из Элвиннского леса.", Objectives AC enUS : "General Marcus Jonathan in Stormwind will accept a commendation from Elwynn Forest.  Bringing him such a document will reward you with a choice of armor." ; Wowhead enUS : "General Marcus Jonathan in Stormwind will accept a commendation from Elwynn Forest.  Bringing him such a document will reward you with a choice of armor.",  OLD Details : "Если у тебя есть рекомендации от одного из наших маршалов, покажи их мне. Взамен я дам тебе пару Львиных перчаток.", Details AC enUS : "If you earn a commendation from one of our Marshals, then bring it to me.  It will be good for one of our Lion Emblem gloves." ; Wowhead enUS : "If you earn a commendation from one of our Marshals, then bring it to me. It will be good for one of our Lion Emblem gloves."
